## Scope and coverage

All checked supplied Weeks1–3 are prepared. O001–O008 retain the exact original Week1 criteria and banks with full reused explanations, figures and historical source-case limits. O009–O014 add expected-pay effort/social derivatives, labour gifts, relative-pay design, charitable denominators, childhood allocations and mentoring offer inference. Existing later syllabus/sample questions are not assumed completely keyed.

The [ingestion state](ingestion_state.json) complete revision3 is committed under `INGEST-20261018-BE-R3-COMPLETE`. The [current pass](../../../runtime/ingest/logs/20261018T195113+0200_weeks1-3_five_courses.md) explicitly certifies this course independently, even if its other-course sections remain in progress. Linked earlier checked passes establish preserved prior coverage; current source/note identities match their recorded bounds. [Manifest](source_manifest.md) maps exact checked headings/fingerprints to all lessons.

Formal discrimination/intergroup-contact readings, unspecified later-age studies, current SIS availability, absent poll/sample-exam keys, a full principal-agent contract with missing participation/risk constraints and whole-semester/exam completeness remain excluded. Reported effect percentages remain study/version/outcome-specific. No personal deadline or learner evidence is inferred. The retention horizon is null unless the preserved metadata explicitly says otherwise. No whole-syllabus/exam completeness, learner result, mastery or review date is inferred.

