Payoff/game and treatment-versus-model foundations precede effort and field response comparisons. Charity denominators use the earlier reciprocity/experimental distinctions. Childhood payoff patterns precede mentoring measurement and causal interpretation; administrative orientation remains an independent source-reading branch. Every dependency precedes its dependent, with no cycles or unsupported prerequisite. Independent branches may be reordered; skipping support requires actual current or explicitly compatible evidence. Each ready block includes the full needed explanation, examples/assets, diagnostic and repair, fading practice, two immediate and two delayed full forms, complete keys/components and stopping rules.

## Execution and assessment contract

This substantive revision adopts `self-contained-lessons-v1`, [[03_Agents/references/LESSON_CONTENT.md]]. Teach delivers complete embedded explanations and figures without requiring original-note retrieval. Earlier named item IDs/versions, all permitted acquisition pairs, criteria, tools/assistance and delayed conditions are preserved. Complete-note reuse and formula typesetting do not reduce or silently expand scoring criteria. New objectives use fully keyed W1/S1/I1/I2/D1/D2 forms. Every full form covers every listed component and every permitted pair therefore covers them twice. Diagnostics, worked/support and narrow corrections are never substitutes. Only the explicitly named prepared full forms can count as evidence; extra verified explanation/practice may support the same method.

Delayed retrieval follows each lesson’s explicit preserved timing/exposure contract. Do not impose a new latest-exposure clock on an earlier acquisition-only contract; record intervening study and apply its named conditions. New objectives require at least24 actual hours after acquisition and most recent relevant teaching/solution exposure, before recap, fresh and unassisted. A midnight date change alone never qualifies. Unknown conditions are unscorable for independence. Teach alone records actual outcomes; recall alone schedules from committed evidence.

## Revisions and evidence compatibility

The complete exact prior P001 bundle is preserved under [curriculum_history/P001/](curriculum_history/P001/learning_plan.md); all earlier history remains untouched. Earlier stable IDs are retained, with objective revision incremented for full-content teaching preparation. Criterion/item contracts, essential components, accepted reasoning and conditions remain unchanged after semantic inspection. The index and lessons list all previously approved exact compatible tuples plus the exact immediately preceding active tuple. No wildcard compatibility, automatic regrading or fictional acquisition is introduced. New IDs have revision1/C1, no old compatible tuple and require their own actual acquisition evidence. No objective is retired/split/merged/recycled. Existing named requirements remain binding and must match the index and lesson; unchanged criteria alone do not erase a historical gate. No new gate or learner result is inferred merely from metadata/teaching updates; genuinely new capabilities cannot borrow old results. All 8 old named reassessment fields are null and remain so. Old 8 acquisition permits ONLY the exact I1+I2 pair, with no D/generated substitution, and all 8 delayed rules retain their later-of-acquisition/latest-relevant-exposure anchor. O008-C1 remains the historical P001 Week1 orientation case; current downstream coverage is explicitly separate. P001 is preserved byte-for-byte, including all old metadata. Source review of all 58 new pages, 5 notes and 16 assets found no unresolved material findings; all quantitative additions here are explicitly hypothetical derivations from those checked notes.

## Validation and readiness

Owner checks current complete ingest journal, note/asset hashes, checked headings and manifest mappings, complete passage fidelity/figures, every assessment route/key/component, full dependency graph, prior snapshot bytes, and matching bundle metadata. New hypothetical solutions are recomputed from the embedded identities. A separate independent curriculum checker must inspect final content and resolve findings before atomic publication; see final review appendix. After publication run records.py verify for plan/manifest and each ready indexed lesson, and verify ingest state separately. Vault baseline has nine pre-existing absent empty course mirrors only.

## Independent curriculum review and owner repairs

The fresh independent reviewer `/root/be_curriculum_check` inspected the initial immutable draft intent `3d9d63e9a8a55124202b7632b70a7090b13dd5035676bc47a03e3bae7e16c172`: all 14 lesson bodies, all 44 permitted acquisition routes and their full keys/rubrics, the 10 selected checked notes plus hub, 24 assets, 34 fingerprints, compatibility and the exact 10-file P001 archive. Its consolidated initial report identified five plan issues and no note error: old active advance/escalation paragraphs retained ingestion2; O014 toy mean-component-z arithmetic was mislabeled as composite-SD units; O014 routed a trust-survey distinction to O013; O009 derivative primes were baseline symbols; and old escalation wording routed missing lesson explanations to ingest. No other content, arithmetic, coverage or compatibility findings were reported in that full review.

The owner repaired those five issues in the unpublished draft: active old-eight handoff tuples now say ingestion3 while historical tuples are preserved; all six O014 forms define/report the same mean-component-z index and benchmark units, explicitly distinguishing optional subsequent composite standardization without changing any numeric average; an included O014 measurement/index foundation precedes its diagnostic, with correct O001/O013/local repair routes; all six O009 keys use superscript derivative primes; and escalation distinguishes note/provenance repairs owned by ingest from missing lesson explanations owned by plan. All old criteria, acquisition/delayed contracts, named requirement fields, historical evidence compatibility, original P001 bytes, checked-note passages, figures and source fingerprints remain unchanged. No learner result is created.

These are factual initial-review and repair records, not a claim of final approval. Atomic publication is conditional on the same independent checker confirming this final intent and affected context with no unresolved material findings; the parent task records that exact final digest and actual receipt. The checker must verify the complete preserved scope carried forward as well as these repairs before readiness is published.
